Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.98,sign_0_1_December_17th__S,,0,0,0,,December 17th, Stellar Year 2144
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:30.94,Flashback,S,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:05.95,Dates,S,0,0,0,,July 27th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:08.25,Italics Top,Haruto,0,0,0,,It's so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.49,0:03:09.94,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Stop it! You'll make me feel hot, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:11.37,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,It's hot, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:12.93,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Summer's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:13.65,Italics,Haruto,0,0,0,,I'm taking my clothes off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:14.52,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,No, you aren't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:17.24,Italics,Lecca,0,0,0,,You know the saying, \N"Shinto mekkyaku sureba" or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.83,Italics,Kaie,0,0,0,,That sounds like something Kaie would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:21.26,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,"Shinto mekkyaku"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.98,0:03:23.30,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,This is the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:26.53,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,Where we went to look at \Nthe flowers! I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:28.55,Italics,Kino,0,0,0,,We did it right after we got deployed here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.89,0:03:30.86,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,Would you like to dance again, Anju?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:33.44,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,We're just about to start a battle, Daiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:34.35,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.61,0:03:45.45,Dates,Daiya,0,0,0,,April 5th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.05,0:03:43.18,Flashback Top,Kaie,0,0,0,,I'm from Luskinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:45.44,Flashback Top,Kurena,0,0,0,,I was with Shin before, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.67,0:03:47.05,Flashback,Raiden,0,0,0,,Set it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.05,0:03:48.41,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.41,0:03:49.70,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,What unit are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.79,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,Scale. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:52.98,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Luskinia.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.38,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,And you, Mr. Daiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:58.09,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Just call me "Daiya." Claymore, in my case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:03:59.87,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,And what year are you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.87,0:04:01.01,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,Fourth year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:02.92,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:05.23,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Most people here are fourth-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:08.55,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,That's the one thing \Nthat's equal about all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:12.40,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Hey, any girls you've got your eye on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:13.89,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,You're asking that after we just met?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.89,0:04:17.07,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Her, maybe? You two seemed close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:19.91,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,No! I'm not telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:22.22,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Why? You like keeping secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:24.51,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,No more secrets from anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:28.13,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,That's right. Daiya does nothing \Nbut stare at Anju all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.13,0:04:29.77,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,It's obvious he likes her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.03,0:04:34.29,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,You guys seem to be having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:36.18,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,Daiya, you're embarrassing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:38.42,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Shut up and help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.69,0:04:41.84,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,Hey, Daiya says he wants to talk to Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.20,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Theo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.17,0:04:48.17,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:50.23,Flashback,Anju,0,0,0,,Did you call me, Daiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:53.27,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:55.38,Flashback,Lecca,0,0,0,,Then what's it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.65,0:05:00.39,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Well, it's just kind of a sausage-fest \Nover here, so I thought it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:07.84,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,Hey, speaking of sausage-fests, \NI heard the craziest thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:08.57,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.57,0:05:10.88,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,There's some rich girl \Nwho's working as a Handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:13.29,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Wow, sounds interesting! Tell me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:17.39,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,She's obviously a really hot pig princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.39,0:05:19.07,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,With huge tits, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.07,0:05:20.39,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,Since she's a pig, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:22.59,Flashback,Kurena,0,0,0,,She's a white pig. It's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:23.27,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:28.01,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,I could see her with a \Nbig pink rose on her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:32.29,Flashback,Anju,0,0,0,,And I bet she talks \Nall prim and proper, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:34.19,Flashback,Mikuri,0,0,0,,She'll greet you with, \N"And a fine morning to you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.19,0:05:36.03,Flashback,Mikuri,0,0,0,,And says "very well" instead of "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.85,0:05:39.83,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,I can tell you for sure \NI'd snap at her in the first 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.83,0:05:41.44,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,No, we don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:45.94,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,She may be a frail little girl who's never held \Nanything heavier than a knitting needle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:49.23,Flashback,Lecca,0,0,0,,She can't handle wind or rain, \Nand she'll wilt in too much sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.23,0:05:49.93,Flashback,Lecca,0,0,0,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:51.48,Flashback,Myna,0,0,0,,Are you talking about a soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:56.12,Flashback,Raiden,0,0,0,,If she was mumbling at me \Nin a thin, frail voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:57.75,Flashback,Raiden,0,0,0,,I'd get pretty annoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:05:59.61,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,Guys, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:03.50,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,She's just some ugly woman who has to work \N'cause she couldn't get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:06.19,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,What? She's obviously a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:12.34,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,She's descended to the land of mortals \Nto save us poor Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:16.06,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know if she's a \Nkind princess or a goddess, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:21.20,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,But I'd like to meet her someday, \Nif she really exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:23.60,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,Well, I can tell you \Nshe's not either of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.60,0:06:26.95,Flashback,Theo,0,0,0,,She's a white pig, at the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.95,0:06:29.04,Flashback,All,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:37.03,Flashback,Daiya,0,0,0,,Anju!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:38.10,Flashback,Anju,0,0,0,,Daiya...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:43.33,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,Commander! Are they drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:44.49,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:46.88,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,There's nothing in those cups but water, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:48.33,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,It's water, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:50.60,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,But, well, they look like they're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:51.99,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,I think it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:55.20,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,You mean you don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:57.62,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,People can tell things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:06:59.77,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:07.91,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,Originally, people who were going off to battle \Nhated the cherry blossoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.27,0:07:10.43,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,The flowers have a short lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:13.85,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,They all bloom at the same time \Nand fall at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:18.87,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,They leave the branches behind easily, \Nas if there's nothing holding them back at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:24.13,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,But I like the way they're so bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:27.29,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,Look, I made it my mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:29.45,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,What's your mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:32.32,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,There's a story behind it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:33.68,Flashback,S,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:35.58,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:37.91,Flashback,S,0,0,0,,It wasn't mine to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.05,0:07:41.22,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,Hey, you two lovebirds!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:44.03,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,You need to enjoy yourselves \Nwhile you've got the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.03,0:07:46.55,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,If you can't laugh anymore, you lose, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:47.82,Flashback,All,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:50.09,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:53.73,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,I was worried there might be a Legion attack \Nwhile we were out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:55.27,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,I'm glad there wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:59.11,Flashback,Kurena,0,0,0,,I told you! He can always tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.45,0:08:02.31,Flashback,Lecca,0,0,0,,He's the headless Reaper \Nof the Eastern Front.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.31,0:08:04.67,Flashback,Lecca,0,0,0,,I heard the rumors, \Nbut I guess they're true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:07.92,Flashback,Myna,0,0,0,,I heard you're looking for your missing head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:10.09,Flashback,Mikuri,0,0,0,,If I pull that scarf off, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:12.03,Flashback,Lecca,0,0,0,,Do you not have a head?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:17.09,Flashback,Myna,0,0,0,,That's why the skeleton mark has no head!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:19.30,Flashback,All,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.59,0:08:25.59,Flashback,Lecca,0,0,0,,Well, let's make \Nthe next six months good ones, Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:27.02,Flashback,Mikuri,0,0,0,,Glad to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.58,0:08:27.66,Flashback,Myna,0,0,0,,Glad to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.02,0:08:28.11,Flashback,Haruto,0,0,0,,Glad to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.77,0:08:28.94,Flashback,Kino,0,0,0,,Glad to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.41,0:08:29.69,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,Glad to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:30.65,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Glad to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:31.82,Flashback,Kurena,0,0,0,,Gwad to hawve you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:35.58,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:37.49,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,"Reaper."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:39.36,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:42.69,Flashback,Raiden,0,0,0,,You're sure popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:44.56,Flashback,Raiden,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:47.81,Flashback,Shin,0,0,0,,That's not like you at all. \NIs it going to rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:50.01,Flashback,Lecca,0,0,0,,Shooting stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:51.83,Flashback,Myna,0,0,0,,No way! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:52.96,Flashback Top,Theo,0,0,0,,Shooting stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:54.41,Flashback Top,Theo,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:56.51,Flashback,Kujo,0,0,0,,Don't go chasing after them. \NYou're not a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.17,0:08:58.39,Flashback,Kaie,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:10.45,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,It's been four months since then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:12.80,Italics,Haruto,0,0,0,,There are a lot of fewer of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:16.54,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,The only number that hasn't gone down \Nis the one on Kujo's blackboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:19.64,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,I wish time would just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:21.06,Italics,Anju,0,0,0,,That'd be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.06,0:09:24.40,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it won't for the next two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:26.95,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:28.20,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Beginning coordination mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:32.20,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Um, Captain, today...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:34.39,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,Oh, are you scared, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:36.00,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,If you're scared, why not quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:39.09,Main,Shin,0,0,0,,Major, if it's too much, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.09,0:09:39.79,Italics,L,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.79,0:09:43.03,Italics,L,0,0,0,,I'll do what I can until the very end!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:45.97,Main,S,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.94,0:10:02.35,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Skorpions. Incoming artillery fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:07.22,Main,K,0,0,0,,They really are in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.22,0:10:11.41,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Wait, are those the Skorpions \Nfrom the next unit over?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:13.50,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,There are just too many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:19.50,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,They've learned that we can\N anticipate their routes and ambush them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:22.50,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,So they start by blasting \Nevery hiding spot with artillery
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:25.94,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,and then finish us off with the Löwe \Nwhen we're flushed out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:30.72,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,That's a lot of effort for a bunch of guys \Nin aluminum coffins like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:33.04,Main,Haruto,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I could cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:38.41,Italics,L,0,0,0,,If only we could use mortars...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:52.78,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Burnt Tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.04,0:10:54.74,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Can someone from the Sixth Platoon go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:56.70,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,Not now, with all that artillery fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:58.61,Italics,Kurena,0,0,0,,With this landscape, if we go now...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.73,0:11:01.66,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Daiya, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:02.77,Italics,Daiya,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:11.68,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Black Dog, get away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:13.08,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Black Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:26.69,Main,D,0,0,0,,Anju...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:36.29,Italics Top,Kurena,0,0,0,,I can go now, Burnt Tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:38.08,Italics Top,Kurena,0,0,0,,I can aim from above!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:40.64,Italics Top,S,0,0,0,,They'll just shoot back at you, Gunslinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:43.16,Italics Top,L,0,0,0,,Laughing Fox, can you circle downstream \Nand come back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:44.97,Italics Top,Theo,0,0,0,,The March Hare could, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:45.62,Main,Lecca,0,0,0,,I'm not ending up a hunk of scrap metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:47.05,Italics,Myna,0,0,0,,Make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:47.93,Main,Lecca,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.85,0:11:51.40,Main,Lecca,0,0,0,,Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:57.01,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Burnt Tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:02.10,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Burnt Tail...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.61,0:12:06.84,Italics,Myna,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:10.78,Main,S,0,0,0,,March Hare, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.78,0:12:14.20,Main,S,0,0,0,,Snow Witch, take over command from Black Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:15.61,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:19.14,Main,A,0,0,0,,Yes, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:29.47,Main,S,0,0,0,,Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:30.57,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.99,0:12:36.07,Main,S,0,0,0,,If I told you to cut your Para-RAID, \Nwould you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:37.44,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:41.28,Main,S,0,0,0,,You've never seen a person get shot, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:42.73,Italics,L,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:45.77,Main,S,0,0,0,,I can't let Daiya become a Legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:50.54,Main,S,0,0,0,,If you think you can't handle it, \Njust cut the link.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:52.73,Italics,L,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:56.52,Italics,L,0,0,0,,This is all I can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.91,0:12:59.71,Italics,L,0,0,0,,but it's my responsibility as a Handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.44,0:13:18.56,Main,All,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.56,0:13:18.98,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,I'll carry that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:22.08,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I'm fine. It's light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:23.23,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,I'm just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:24.45,Main,Theo,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:29.74,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Really, I can carry it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:31.12,Main,Anju,0,0,0,,Right, Kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:38.83,Main,Kurena,0,0,0,,Let's play darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:46.67,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,We finally lost Daiya and Lecca, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.06,0:13:50.40,Main,S,0,0,0,,Here, it's just a question \Nof when it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:52.09,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:57.26,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,You'll still fight, \Neven if you're the last one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:13:59.30,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,Until you make a grave for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:02.23,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,For your brother, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:04.94,Main,S,0,0,0,,It's all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:07.58,Main,S,0,0,0,,My brother hasn't forgiven me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.03,0:14:10.64,Main,S,0,0,0,,He still blames me. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.01,0:14:15.47,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,He's obsessed with his brother's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:22.67,Main,Raiden,0,0,0,,I guess you really are a Reaper \Nin search of a missing head.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.77,0:14:28.99,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:34.82,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:41.48,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,Everything. It's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:44.42,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,That Mom and Dad died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:47.33,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,The fact that I'm about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:49.47,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,It's all...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:51.67,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,All because of your sin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:56.92,Flashback,Rei,0,0,0,,Shin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:02.54,Main,L,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:04.30,Main,L,0,0,0,,Thanks, Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:07.12,Main,L,0,0,0,,Is this a real egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:10.31,Main,A,0,0,0,,Artificial.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:11.59,Main,A,0,0,0,,The strawberries are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.59,0:15:13.61,Main Top,A,0,0,0,,Sorry, there wasn't time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:16.64,Dates,A,0,0,0,,{\fad(439,434)}July 27th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:15.04,Main Top,L,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:17.15,Main Top,A,0,0,0,,I'm glad you came, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:19.33,Main,A,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Lena.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.97,0:15:22.39,Main,L,0,0,0,,But your present was delivered yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.39,0:15:23.71,Main,A,0,0,0,,Oh, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:26.10,Main,L,0,0,0,,Why a rocking chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.10,0:15:27.48,Main,A,0,0,0,,"Why"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:29.10,Main,A,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:30.62,Main,A,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:35.82,Main,A,0,0,0,,Well, actually, Nicolaus gave it to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:37.09,Main,A,0,0,0,,but I'm not going to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:39.84,Main,L,0,0,0,,It seemed like someone older picked it, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:42.69,Main,A,0,0,0,,But you've looked like \Nyou need more sleep lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:44.58,Main,A,0,0,0,,It's perfect for a nap, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:48.88,Main,L,0,0,0,,Annette, you always end up with guys \Nwho are in the wrong age range.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:50.63,Main,A,0,0,0,,Well, all the guys my age...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:54.73,Main,A,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.73,0:15:56.42,Main,A,0,0,0,,They're too childish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:15:59.46,Main,A,0,0,0,,So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:02.35,Main,A,0,0,0,,You came to ask me something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:06.66,Main,L,0,0,0,,Hey, Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:07.64,Main,A,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:10.53,Main,L,0,0,0,,Just hypothetically,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:14.74,Main,L,0,0,0,,if the Para-RAIDs had some kind \Nof effect on a person's mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:18.19,Main,A,0,0,0,,Oh, then it'd go "pop."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:23.44,Main,A,0,0,0,,We'd pop the Processor's skull right open \Nand do a thorough exam of their brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:26.12,Main,A,0,0,0,,Just like we were gonna do with Undertaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:28.09,Main,A,0,0,0,,And when it was done,\N we'd just throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:30.69,Main,A,0,0,0,,For a Handler, we'd immediately \Ngive them a thorough exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:32.76,Main,A,0,0,0,,and then transfer them to another unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.28,Main,L,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:38.44,Main,L,0,0,0,,Leave the cake. \NI'll come back and eat it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:38.96,Main,L,0,0,0,,Lena?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:44.32,Main,A,0,0,0,,I'll make the usual cake next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:47.06,Main,L,0,0,0,,This was just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:48.26,Main,L,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.84,0:17:06.00,Flashback,S,0,0,0,,I can't let Daiya become part of the Legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:14.55,Main,L,0,0,0,,Captain Nouzen has been doing that for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:18.33,Main,L,0,0,0,,to keep his comrades \Nfrom becoming part of the Legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:25.23,Dates,L,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,437)}July 28th, Stellar Year 2148
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:25.37,Main Top,L,0,0,0,,Two Processors died in the last battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:28.67,Main,L,0,0,0,,One was mortally wounded, \Nbut it was his combat commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:31.85,Main,L,0,0,0,,not the Legion, who dealt the killing blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:33.47,Main,S,0,0,0,,How many machines do we have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:36.32,Main,L,0,0,0,,Sixteen people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.54,0:17:41.95,Main,L,0,0,0,,Our military's mortars have a range \Nclose to that of the Skorpion's howitzers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.95,0:17:43.49,Main,L,0,0,0,,We can use them to provide support \Nat the front lines
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.49,0:17:46.06,Main,L,0,0,0,,and save the lives of the Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:53.75,Main,L,0,0,0,,No, we can lessen attrition at the front lines \Nand defend the nation more efficiently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:57.82,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,Mortars need to be reloaded after firing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:18:00.43,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,And they're set up \Nin the middle of a minefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:02.56,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,It's too close to the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:07.02,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,You're telling us \Nto take that risk for the Eighty-Six?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.10,0:18:12.03,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,Eighty-Six can be replaced, \Nbut Republic soldiers can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:13.69,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,I can't authorize their use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.31,0:18:16.98,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,Both the military and the people \Nwant a homeland defense
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.98,0:18:20.05,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,that's technologically advanced and ethical, \Nwith zero casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.35,0:18:24.13,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,And the military's job is \Nto follow the will of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:25.02,Main,L,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:28.19,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,Lena, how many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:31.50,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,Stop siding with the Eighty-Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.50,0:18:34.23,Main,L,0,0,0,,But, they're human...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.59,0:18:36.98,Main,L,0,0,0,,They must be suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.59,0:18:40.57,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,I have another mission for the Spearheads, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:45.49,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,A new Legion base has been confirmed \Nto be under construction near their area.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:47.47,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,As soon as they're ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:51.84,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,they are to advance immediately \Non the base and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:56.43,Main,L,0,0,0,,Wait, even before replacing the ones they lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:59.97,Main,L,0,0,0,,Why don't we get new replacements, \Nlike the other units?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:04.15,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,This base exists to support the \NLegion in their advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.15,0:19:06.49,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,If it's not taken out now, before it's built,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:09.83,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,it'll be Spearhead that suffers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.59,0:19:15.48,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,You want to save them, right, Major Milizé?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:17.72,Main,Karlstahl,0,0,0,,Or am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.23,0:19:24.73,Main,L,0,0,0,,Understood, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:31.31,Main,L,0,0,0,,This concludes the mission briefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:32.60,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:35.48,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:37.75,Main,L,0,0,0,,I know you don't even have replacements \Nfor your casualties yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:39.55,Main,L,0,0,0,,and we're already sending \Nyou on a new mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:40.82,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It's nothing new.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.43,0:19:45.14,Italics,S,0,0,0,,We're aware of the Legion base as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.04,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It's almost certainly a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:51.20,Main,L,0,0,0,,You know it's a trap, \Nand yet you'll attack anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:54.64,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It may be more dangerous to leave it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:59.13,Main,L,0,0,0,,I wish we could've used the \Nmortars to provide support.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:20:00.90,Main,L,0,0,0,,But I couldn't get authorization.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:02.48,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,Oh, those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:05.38,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,I've never seen them used.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:07.15,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,I'd be surprised if they still worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:08.97,Main,L,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.29,0:20:10.73,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:12.84,Italics,Theo,0,0,0,,We weren't counting on them to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:15.11,Italics,Kino,0,0,0,,Stress is bad for your skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:17.64,Main,L,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:19.35,Main,L,0,0,0,,That's all for today, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:22.64,Main,L,0,0,0,,Try to get some rest tonight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:24.34,Italics,T,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:25.87,Italics,Kino,0,0,0,,Goodnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.87,0:20:26.62,Italics,Haruto,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:27.56,Italics,Mikuri,0,0,0,,Goodnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:28.44,Italics,Raiden,0,0,0,,Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.87,0:20:33.90,Main,L,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.21,0:20:36.49,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Major, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:40.96,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Your voice sounds a little on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:44.62,Italics,L,0,0,0,,Make sure you get some rest tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.15,0:20:46.16,Main,L,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:49.44,Italics,S,0,0,0,,You can get sweets inside the walls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.76,0:20:51.33,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Why not eat some and take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.19,0:20:52.77,Italics,S,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:54.79,Main,L,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:59.06,Main,L,0,0,0,,You just sounded like your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.10,0:21:04.07,Main,L,0,0,0,,He gave me chocolate when things were bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.42,0:21:07.71,Main,L,0,0,0,,You really are brothers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.71,0:21:09.91,Main,L,0,0,0,,It's far worse for you than it is for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:13.84,Main,L,0,0,0,,You must like sweets too,\N right, Captain Nouzen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:19.17,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Yes. Did my brother say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:19.92,Main,L,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.99,0:21:24.50,Italics,S,0,0,0,,What was his expression when he said it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:27.25,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Was he smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:29.18,Main,L,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.61,0:21:31.29,Main,L,0,0,0,,He had such kind eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:36.76,Main,L,0,0,0,,I remember them really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:38.43,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.16,0:21:42.22,Main,L,0,0,0,,It's an important memory for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.83,0:21:44.69,Main,L,0,0,0,,I'll never forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:52.33,Main,L,0,0,0,,Of course, this time I spend talking \Nto you is very important as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.29,0:22:00.16,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:05.88,Main,L,0,0,0,,O-Okay, goodnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.80,0:22:08.03,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:31.19,Main,L,0,0,0,,I won't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.31,0:23:38.34,Main,L,0,0,0,,"Will You Remember Me?"
